Description: Numark Mixtrack (Pro) 3: wheel edge, loop rolls, BEATS knob
 - Jog wheel: while the platter is touched (scratch, iCut, fast seek) the
   wheel no longer also bends the pitch; on a stopped deck, turning the wheel
   by its edge (platter not touched) moves through the track, as the wheel
   edge does with the controller's bundled software.
 - New option "SHIFT + Auto Loop pads: loop rolls" (off by default): SHIFT +
   Auto Loop pads 1-4 play loop rolls of 1/8, 1/4, 1/2 and 1 beat while held.
 - New option "BEATS knob" (default: effect unit dry/wet, unchanged): the
   knob can instead halve/double the time (parameter 1) of the focused effect,
   like the controller's beat multiplier with its bundled software.
 - Fix: PAD MODE + BEATS changed the gain of [Sampler0] and of the other
   deck's samplers; it now changes samplers 1-4 (left) or 5-8 (right) only.
 Candidate for upstream (the user submits it; AI-written, see AGENTS.md).
Author: DecksmithOS
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-22
